# Hooks must keep LF endings. A CRLF shebang becomes `/bin/bash\r`, which macOS
# and Linux report as "bad interpreter" — every hook fails to run, quietly.
# Windows contributors with core.autocrlf=false would otherwise commit CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Markdown and JSON normalise to LF in the repo; checkout is left to the platform.
*.md text
*.json text
